<title>UK: LB Rheinland Pfalz sets 300 bln lire 4-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland Pfalz sets 300 bln lire 4-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager IMI Lux</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEILAND PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    10.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.434   PAY DATE  L 09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
